      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Today I learned “First … then …”, but I don’t know how to use it."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：这很简单，你可以说 “先生再见” ！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：這很簡單，你可以說 “先生再見” ！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhè hěn jiǎn dān nǐ kě yǐ shuō xiān sheng zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
